  "classification_rules_en": [
    "Collection type (exam/thematic) is independent of topic classification.",
    "Question identity includes collection, source ticket and ordinal; numbers overlap across collections.",
    "Every question has one primary leaf for exclusive counts and one or more topic_ids for overlapping filters.",
    "Parent categories are inherited from taxonomy nodes, not duplicated in topic_ids.",
    "Assign only tested facts; incidental words and numbers do not justify a topic.",
    "Numbers covers specific numeric thresholds, periods, counts, dimensions, technical standards and calendar interpretation; qualitative speed advice does not belong to speeds.",
    "An explicit priority sign can receive both signs.priority and priority.sign. A mandatory direction sign is not a priority sign.",
    "Signs includes static signs, vehicle plates and road markings. Officer signals and traffic lights belong to priority; they are not static signs.",
    "Reserved leaves preserve user-requested future categories with zero matching questions.",
    "These are study classifications, not changes or independent verification of the source traffic rules."
